designrc (1.9.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add mutually exclusive sheeting boundaries and Cover Ribs on all four sides.
  * Fit rib caps to the sheeting boundary and recessed wood or tube spars.
  * Add perpendicular spar placement and show tip fields only in Manual mode.
  * Keep plywood joiners flat and straight across mirrored halves and panels;
    use the same direction for spar references and alignment warnings.
  * Set metric install spar/joiner locations to 35% for swept-tip clearance.
  * Update versioned Help, About, README, and website for 1.9.0.

 -- Barry Foust <barryfx@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

designrc (1.7.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add an Ubuntu 24.04 compatibility build with a separately rebuilt OCCT
    and Ubuntu 24.04 Qt/ICU libraries, avoiding the libc6 2.43 requirement.
  * Keep the application version at 1.7.1; increment only the Debian revision.
    Windows and Fedora installers are unchanged.

 -- Barry Foust <barryfx@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

designrc (1.7.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add perpendicular control hinges, full-width control skins, and practical
    hinge-spar defaults; expose sleeve bore dimensions and preserve mirrored IDs.
  * Improve rear-spar clearance corrections, global-unit default conversion,
    and aileron/flap generation progress reporting.
  * Update installed help and release metadata.

 -- Barry Foust <barryfx@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

